  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced deterministic build and SourceLink support for better CI/CD traceability.\n- Optimized cryptographic engines with Span-first design and AEAD envelope support.\n- Added Randomization.Core with Xoshiro-based PRNG (XoshiroFallback) and reseed scheduling.\n- Improved TaskManager with async-safe cancellation and lightweight scheduling.\n- Enhanced Identity and Injection subsystems for performance and modularity.\n- General cleanup, updated documentation, and improved unit test coverage.",
